              "content": "Luna is the heart of our kennel: a bold, affectionate little girl who greets every visitor as though they were an old friend. She is BAER, patella and heart tested clear, and carries the dense, plush double coat and fox-like expression the breed standard asks for. Best of Breed at the 2025 Spring Club Show, she now passes her calm, outgoing nature on to every litter.",
